<title>FRANCE: Casino hypermarket sales up 8.6 pct in Oct.</title>
<headline>Casino hypermarket sales up 8.6 pct in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Casino chairman Georges Plassat said on Thursday sales at the French retailers hypermarkets rose 8.6 percent in October from a year earlier while sales at its supermarkets rose 5.7 percent, both on a like-for-like basis.</p>
<p>Plassat was speaking at a seminar in Paris organised by Ferri.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
